flowchart TD
    A([User Uploads Project\nProposal PDF]) --> B[PDF Text Extraction\npdfplumber / PyPDF2 / Raw Bytes]
    B --> B1{Text\nExtracted?}
    B1 -- No --> ERR([Error: Unreadable PDF])
    B1 -- Yes --> C[Clean Text Ready]

    C --> D[Auto-Detect Duration\nScan Gantt for M1...M10]
    D --> D1{Month Markers\nFound?}
    D1 -- Yes --> D2[Override duration\nwith detected months]
    D1 -- No --> D3[Use user-provided\nduration input]

    C --> E[5-Strategy WBS Task Extraction]

    E --> S1[Strategy 1:\nWBS Table Section\nNumbered task rows]
    S1 --> CHK1{tasks >= 4?}
    CHK1 -- No --> S2[Strategy 2:\nGantt Chart Rows\nStrip M1-M10 ticks]
    CHK1 -- Yes --> S3

    S2 --> CHK2{tasks >= 4?}
    CHK2 -- No --> S3
    CHK2 -- Yes --> S3

    S3[Strategy 3: Always Runs\nSpecific Objectives SO1 SO2\nStrip leading To prefix] --> CHK3{tasks >= 5?}
    CHK3 -- No --> S4[Strategy 4:\nAction-Verb Heuristic\ndevelop implement design build]
    CHK3 -- Yes --> VALID

    S4 --> CHK4{tasks >= 5?}
    CHK4 -- No --> S5[Strategy 5:\nT5 Zero-Shot NLP\nSummarize 300-word chunks]
    CHK4 -- Yes --> VALID

    S5 --> CHK5{tasks >= 4?}
    CHK5 -- No --> FB[Research WBS\nTemplate Fallback\n10 standard FYP tasks]
    CHK5 -- Yes --> VALID
    FB --> VALID

    VALID[is_valid_task filter\nRemove noise: References\nBudget Appendix etc.] --> TASKS([Task List Ready\nmax 12 tasks])

    TASKS --> XGB[XGBoost Effort Estimation\nPredict total effort via\nFunction Points]
    XGB --> DIST[Distribute effort per task\nusing FP weight array]
    DIST --> EFFORTS([effort_hours per task])

    EFFORTS --> LR[Logistic Regression\nDelay Risk Prediction\nNASA metric proxy mapping]
    LR --> BLEND[Blend JIRA probability\nwith Capacity sigmoid risk]
    BLEND --> RISKS([risk_pct and status\nper task])

    EFFORTS --> GANTT[Build Gantt Schedule\nAssign start and end dates\nsequentially]
    RISKS --> GANTT
    GANTT --> DB1[(Save to SQLite DB\nschedule_versions)]
    DB1 --> FRONT([Gantt Chart Displayed\nin Frontend])

    FRONT --> BTN{User Clicks\nAuto-Balance\nWorkload?}
    BTN -- Yes --> RF[Algorithm 6:\nML Workload Balancing\nRandom Forest + LPT + Fairness Guard]
    RF --> BOARD([Task Assignment Board\nDisplayed with confidence scores])
